WEBVTT

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.270
Writing articles.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.440
That's what journalists do.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:18.580
I, Odori Momoha, a member of the Seiou High School journalism club,

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.500
consider this to be a student's privilege.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.460
That is, to capture and chronicle these moments in the pages of "Special Summer Vacations."

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.350
Let's get a feel for them...

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.420
A walk under a clear sky while taking a breath of the fresh open air...

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.430
Summer holidays feel kind of special!

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.060
Okay!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.950
This year's Pu...

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.080
TL note: She's trying to say "Pulitzer," as in the Pulitzer Prize.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.070
Pu... Puritsu...

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.820
I'll capture the Puri-whatever!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.030
Mika...

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:59.150
Was there any point in setting the alarm clock?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:39.220
Note: She's probably imitating a Saint Seiya character's war cry or similar.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.250
Odiyaa!

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:39.220
Doriyaa!

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.430
Chesto!

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.140
Hey! Get to work! Get to work!

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.700
This place is huge...

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.860
Is this really Japan?

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.290
I wonder if they are paying their taxes as they should...

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.500
My lady,

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.890
everyone,

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:19.860
I've brought you all drinks.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.110
Thank you.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.720
Oh! A messenger from heaven!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.680
No!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:27.100
We are only here today for work.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.140
With all our memories, look straight ahead!

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.800
"With the money we earn, let's go on a field trip together!"

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.960
Didn't we decide it like that?

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.230
The trip will surely be fun!

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.730
There will be a blue sky...

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.140
A pure white inn on the seashore...

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.110
In a charming park!

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:51.790
And...!

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.420
Delicious!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.880
Let's drink Manabi's too!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.880
Hey wait, don't drink it!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.550
Don't drink mine!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.800
Special?

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.380
What's special?

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.560
Summer vacations are special!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.070
Why is that?

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:15.770
The night before, you think, "I'm going to sleep the day away."

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.770
But for some reason, you wake up before the alarm clock rings.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.070
I wonder if there is any point in setting the alarm clock?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.860
Oh I get it!

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.070
It's special!

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.690
It's not special at all.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.090
You go to school, you don't go...

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:31.780
You go to school, you don't go...

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:33.750
It's hot, it isn't hot...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:34.710
It's hot, it isn't hot...

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.760
That's the only difference.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.850
If you believe those changes are special,

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:43.900
then you're the kind of person who's easily swayed by impulsive feelings.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.300
One more time...

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.680
It's not special at all.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.550
You go to school, you don't go...

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.180
You go to school, you don't go...

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:54.720
It's hot, it isn't hot...

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:55.390
It's hot, it isn't hot...

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.450
That's the only difference.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.660
If you believe those changes are special,

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:04.600
then you're the kind of person who's easily swayed by impulsive feelings.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.570
One more time...

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.690
It's not special at all.

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:12.510
You go to school, you don't go...

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:12.990
You go to school, you don't go...

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:14.310
It's hot, it isn't hot...

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:14.910
It's hot, it isn't hot...

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.760
That's the only difference.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:19.870
If you believe those changes are special,

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:24.010
then you're the kind of person who's easily swayed by impulsive feelings.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.430
One more time...!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.510
So, Mei-chan, you're saying that you control your impulses, right?

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.700
I see.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.810
Yes, I don't let my emotions swing like that.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:36.920
What is it?

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:41.050
Speaking of which, it's the first time we've played with Mei-tan outside of school.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.860
Special!

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.940
We are not playing!

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:51.360
We're working, aren't we?

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:53.500
Okay! Break time's o-over!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.260
Weren't you the most relaxed one, Mei-tan?

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.090
I've brought you more drinks.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.520
Good work, Mecchi!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.570
We're going ahead!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:22.320
Yeah.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.790
<i>Ow, ow, ow...</i>

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:24.780
Mikan?

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.010
I'm going to head over there now.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.990
<i>Ow, ow, ow, ow...</i>

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:28.990
What?

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:30.430
Sorry!

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.710
When I went to pick up the phone, I fell.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:36.580
Hey Inamori-san, what are you doing?

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.240
Oh, nice shot!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.360
Thank you very much!

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.920
We're having an opening special, get a sample for free!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.970
Students are on holidays already?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.460
I envy them, so at ease.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.070
I got it!

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:38.070
What?

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:43.790
Summer vacations are special,
probably because of summer's special attractions!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.170
Attractions?

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.590
Special?

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.730
Summer vacation's movies...

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:52.570
Summer flick specials...

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:54.860
Summer vacation ice cream...

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:56.870
are always special, of course!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.660
Even restaurants!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.330
They have a special summer vacation menu!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.270
This ends the explanation of why the summer is so special!

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.310
Mucchi-san!

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.260
Good work you guys! On such a hot day too...

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.310
This hasn't gotten anywhere!

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:17.600
What have you all been doing?

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:21.930
Even with Mei here!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.440
It's a dishonor...

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:28.770
This is why the regular part-timers look down on us students!

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.690
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.020
Nothing at all!

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:44.340
Hey...

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:46.080
Where's mine?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.460
My water pistol!

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:54.650
Special?

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:56.170
Yes! Special!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.190
It's true!

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.210
What is it?

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:01.350
Nothing at all!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:05.270
Summer vacations, the special time just for students.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:12.310
I, as a part of that moment, will investigate further into why it is so special.

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:13.890
Chesto!

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:49.190
I'm back!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.080
You found the store, right?

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.110
Yeah!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.510
This one's for you!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:09.270
The express train will be passing by shortly.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:12.460
Please step back behind the yellow line, away from the tracks.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.180
Hey~

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:23.760
I'm all sweaty!

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:24.680
Strawberry.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:25.600
Tea.

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:26.510
Lemon.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:27.520
Soda.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.020
And for me, shaved ice!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.110
Perfect, isn't it?

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.480
Manabi-chan...

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.480
Spoons...

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.380
Summer, huh?

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.370
We read the train schedule wrong,

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.920
so we had to wait an hour and a half.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:18.400
On a train heading east during our summer vacation, with round-trip "18 kippu" tickets,

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:18.400
Note: "18 kippu" tickets are special discount train passes to travel all across Japan during vacation season.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:24.410
the Seiou Student Council embarks on a special 2-day/1-night field trip.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.660
What will become of this?

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.920
Wait!

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:48.070
No one bothered to check the weather forecast before coming?!

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:50.600
T-That's not my style!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.920
Uh, where is Mika-chin?

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.770
She was right here with us just now...

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.410
Mika-chan was blown away...

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.110
Slowpoke.

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.450
Hey, help her.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:36.350
Why isn't there a single shop out here?

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.770
It's because this is the countryside...

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:41.720
I can't believe this! In the year 2035!

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:44.360
For now, let's find a place where we can rest.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.740
There's nothing else we can do.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:46.900
Mucchi-san!

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:48.150
Yeah?

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:53.990
Now surely Mika-chan intended to fall into the rice field.

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:56.040
No... Go help her.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.160
Yes... Yes...

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:01.090
Yes... Yes...

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:04.290
Yes, I understand.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:06.140
No, no, it's alright.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.370
Don't worry.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:09.700
Yes... Yes...

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:10.710
Yes... Yes...

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.350
Well then, let's do that.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:14.680
She says it's okay!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.310
Thank you very much!

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:23.520
Anyway, I've paid them by direct deposit from the bank.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.320
So, don't cause too much trouble.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:29.450
Also, I cancelled the reservation at the inn you had originally booked.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.370
Is that okay?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.580
Yes! Thank you, onii-chan.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.960
Thanks to you, we could find an inn even in this storm.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.120
Yes.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.700
Yes, I understand!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.390
We won't cause trouble.

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:44.120
Right now they're in the other room going over the guidelines.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.350
Yes, yes, see you!

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.230
Yes, yes, see you!

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:47.340
Yes, yes, see you!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.730
Tada~

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:55.430
Checkout time is at 10:00 a.m.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:55.430
How cute!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.410
The emergency exits are to the left when you leave the room.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.400
They had such old things?

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.190
It's fashionable!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.610
The dinning hall is to the east of the first floor.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.370
The bath is open until 1:00 a.m. at night.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.150
Now that you say it, Mei-chan's kimono would surely be cute!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.020
The things in the fridge are charged separately.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.400
Undress!

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.140
Wai- What are you doing?!

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.150
Stop!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.060
Stop...

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.990
I'm undressing... you!

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.420
Painful! That's my limit!

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:34.440
Too bad...

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:39.240
So, the winner of the underwater breath-holding contest is...

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:41.760
Manabi-chan!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.840
Call 115! Call 115!

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.900
That's not the emergency number here!

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.830
You guys!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.490
You there! Don't sleep!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.900
Don't do handstands meaninglessly!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.440
Turn off the sports news!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.300
You'll get fat!

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:09.230
Don't talk, you!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:16.210
Honestly! Have you all lost sight of our mission objective?

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:19.420
Did you forget why we came out to a place like this together?

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:20.430
Answer!

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:22.430
Yes...

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:30.030
The reason why we are here is to gather ideas for the school festival.

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:32.860
So...

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:35.860
how about we play this together?

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.570
Agreed!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.200
Manabi-chan?

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:04.490
The inn on the seashore, what bad luck we had with that...

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:12.910
"A blue sky; a pure white inn, in a charming park"...

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:16.330
We chose that especially and made reservations...

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:20.300
I thought it could have been a very wonderful memory...

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:37.240
Aren't you one of the students?

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.810
You can't sleep?

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.930
Oh, I see... A group trip!

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:44.870
Yes.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:47.270
It looks like so much fun!

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:51.230
I never had any experiences like that, so I kind of envy you.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:55.170
It's because I don't go to high school.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.670
Oh, I see.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:59.490
Although, even so, I have no regrets.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:02.140
Working at this inn is like a dream for me.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:04.970
In that case... It's better to start earlier, right?

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.400
Since nowadays, you can choose to skip high school.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:09.330
I work hard at it!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:12.790
That's amazing...

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.720
I still haven't yet...

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:21.790
decided on what I want to do.

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.870
I have no talent in anything.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.450
Manabi-chan somehow has a lot of strength...

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:31.530
Mucchi is great at sports and has the reflexes for physical activities...

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:35.000
Momo-chan is doing her best at the journalism club...

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.460
Mei-chan is good at studying,

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:39.800
and very smart...

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.510
Just me...

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:45.680
When I look back, it's just me who is being left behind.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:49.330
I haven't been thinking about the future ahead of me...

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:52.560
I've only been aimlessly going to school...

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:57.190
Hey!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.770
I'll be right there!

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:01.680
That may be so, but that's the point of going to school.

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.330
You can take your time.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:06.380
You'll find what you want to do soon.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:07.770
See you!

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:10.530
Please go tidy up the hall.

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:10.970
All right! All right!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:15.700
I'm sorry, I got in the way of her work.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.750
It's not your fault.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:22.220
It's been a while since she talked with a girl her own age.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:24.950
But that's great!

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.410
You're with your friends on a summer vacation trip, aren't you?

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.160
Yes.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.560
I often did that too, a long time ago.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:33.110
We played a lot, caused trouble for the inn staff,

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:37.540
and at night, we had so much fun talking about the guys we liked.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:42.100
The truth is, I wanted her to go to high school...

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:45.940
But she insisted she wanted to help here, no matter what.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:48.420
She's been working as hard as if she were in school.

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:51.290
I thought that was okay, so I allowed her to.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.870
But the meaning of going to school, there's more to it

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:57.890
than just a place to figure out what you want to do.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:00.760
Um...

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:04.150
"There's more"...

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:05.710
What do you mean by that?

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:08.650
Well then...

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.520
Someday, you'll eventually understand.

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:23.250
The meaning of going to school...

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.660
What I want to do...

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:29.320
I don't really understand such difficult things yet.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:33.530
I don't have any idea of what I should do...

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:37.850
For now, my head is filled with school festival matters.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.420
But...

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:47.070
I have a feeling our stay, at this inn, is going to become a very special memory.

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:50.120
Because... we were together.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:53.610
